  "invariants": {
    "status": "present",
    "value": [
      "Process ordered, at-most-once NEW/FILLED CSV events. NEW creates an order; an identical repeated NEW is a no-op, conflicting NEW returns false. FILLED requires matching side/symbol and positive quantity no greater than remaining. Invalid updates return false without mutation. status returns a fresh snapshot or null. FILLED retries are not deduplicated because the preview supplies no event ID.",
      "Observing a result must not change earlier returned snapshots or mutate input containers."
    ],
